WEBVTT

NOTE
The recorded films retain their earlier Relio name and sample data.

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.750
Alex is an investor.

2
00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:05.500
Alex lives in five of your apps,

3
00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:08.000
and on yesterday’s call, where you made a promise

4
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.000
that isn’t written down anywhere.

5
00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:14.250
Relio is a private Mac app

6
00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:16.750
that remembers the people who matter.

7
00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:19.000
It brings your threads and calls together

8
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:22.250
on one person, encrypted on your Mac.

9
00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:26.000
Open Alex, and the whole relationship

10
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:27.500
is in one place:

11
00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:31.500
Gmail, WhatsApp, iMessage, Telegram and LinkedIn,

12
00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:33.000
with your notes and the next steps

13
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:35.500
right beside the reply.

14
00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:38.250
Drop in the call recording.

15
00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:40.500
Relio transcribes it right on your Mac

16
00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:42.500
and separates the two speakers.

17
00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:45.250
The audio never leaves your Mac.

18
00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:47.500
It spots the promise,

19
00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:49.250
“I’ll send you the deck tomorrow,”

20
00:00:49.250 --> 00:00:51.250
and you confirm it as a task,

21
00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:53.750
linked to the moment you said it.

22
00:00:55.750 --> 00:00:59.000
Today puts Alex first and tells you why:

23
00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:01.000
a promise is due.

24
00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:05.500
And a message from Mom doesn’t get buried under
investors.

25
00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:08.500
A small model running on your Mac

26
00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:10.500
drafts the reply from Alex’s message

27
00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:12.500
and shows its source.

28
00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:14.500
You add what only you can promise,

29
00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:17.250
review it, and send it yourself.

30
00:01:18.500 --> 00:01:20.500
In testing: an assistant

31
00:01:20.500 --> 00:01:22.500
built to send a reply for you,

32
00:01:22.500 --> 00:01:26.250
but only after you approve the exact words.

33
00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:30.250
Search finds the promise and where it came from,

34
00:01:30.250 --> 00:01:32.000
without leaving your Mac.

35
00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:33.500
Mark someone as excluded,

36
00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:36.000
and they vanish from your inbox, search,

37
00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:38.750
and every AI request.

38
00:01:39.250 --> 00:01:43.250
Every channel, every call, remembered on your Mac.

39
00:01:43.250 --> 00:01:46.250
AI drafts. You decide.

40
00:01:46.340 --> 00:01:49.600
Eleven versions in fifteen days.

41
00:01:49.600 --> 00:01:54.620
Next, live account sync and our first founder users.

42
00:01:54.620 --> 00:01:59.140
Relio. Remember the people who matter.
